+ *        {"op":"update"} / {"op":"cancel"}           spbUpdate / SpeedButton2 (golden spbUpdateClick / SpeedButton2Click)
+ *        {"op":"snapshot"}                           Button2 (golden Button2Click -> SaveJPG("Enter"))
